<title>THAILAND: Banpu June 30 year net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Banpu June 30 year net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		16.18     vs	    14.80</p>
<p>    Net			807.46     vs	   714.43</p>
<p>Note: Banpu Coal Plc is a coal miner and importer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950, 652-0642</p>
